/* ---- 6z_talk_more.js ---- */
/* More to talk about. A big batch of everyday lines for every neighbor (onto TALK_MORE), and topics that notice what's
   going on right now (EXTRA_TOPICS, picked by topicLine in 6o_topics.js): the hour, the weather and the season, where
   they're standing, how good a friend Sarah is, what she's wearing, how long she's lived here, her house, what she did
   today, her records, today's holiday, a solved mystery, the day of the week, and whoever else is standing nearby.
   Close friends also tell Sarah something personal, once each (counted in S.npcs[id].shared; old saves start at 0).
   Every topic is guarded: an old save missing a field just means that topic has nothing to say. */

