    cuke: { sunny: 'Sunny! Perfect for a jog! Also perfect for a second jog! Sunscreen, water, jog!', cloudy: 'Cloudy days are great for running. No sun in your eyes. No excuses either!',
        rain: 'Puddles are just tiny obstacle courses. I jumped over forty this morning. I landed in two!', snow: "Snow jog! You lift your knees really high, like this! It's like jogging, but more dramatic!" },
